WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
07:00 — Lesson phone. Before her shift Ruth opens Campus on the phone — one lesson, not twelve tutorial tabs she will never finish.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
15:00 — Weekend iPad. Weekend iPad practice is quiet on purpose; progress without performative hustle posts.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
21:00 — HTTP lab laptop. Laptop HTTP lab finally gets a finished run; she logs it instead of promising “tomorrow.”

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
21:45 — Records. Records on the laptop show labs done — fewer tabs, more closure.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
22:00 — Phone. Phone closes the day. Practice is quiet. That is fine.

